  <name>Throckmorton County — Unmapped Historical Markers</name>
  <description>THC markers in Throckmorton County without an HMDB id (isMissing excluded). 3 with THC coords; 0 geocoded from address; 0 omitted (no usable address). Orange pins are isPending=True — the marker may not be installed yet.</description>
